version: "v0.4"

project:
  name: "TopTverberg"
  description: >-
    A Lean 4 formalization of an almost-six embedding of the 35-dimensional
    simplex into R^6 and a convex six-partition counterexample in every
    dimension d >= 36. New modules construct the concrete single/pair
    comparison data and a conditional reduction to d > 17. The required
    relative lifting theorem for that comparison remains unproved.
  authors: []  # TODO: establish the complete human formalizer list.
  license: "" # TODO: obtain the actual SPDX licence and matching root file.
  responsible_maintainers: [] # TODO: identify responsible human maintainers.

# TODO: public GitHub repository URL and final 40-character commit SHA.
# This is an ordinary proof-development project, so the upstream template
# says to omit repository.substantive_formalization. Do not fabricate a URL
# or repurpose the thin-wrapper field for the ordinary submission repository.

