fidelity:
  divergences: >-
    The original A and B36 statements and their seven interface definitions
    are preserved, with a successful literal independent-statement check.
    The requested unconditional d >= 18 strengthening is not completed.
    Legacy CoherentComparison is documented as overstrong; the alternative
    relative interface retains the prescribed boundary homotopy. The new
    d > 17 theorem explicitly assumes RequiredRelativeLifting. No hidden
    external theorem or new axiom is used to discharge that assumption.

